[
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 1,
    "global_ayah_id": 4785,
    "translation": "以沒落時的星宿盟誓，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 2,
    "global_ayah_id": 4786,
    "translation": "你們的朋友，既不迷誤，又未迷信，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 3,
    "global_ayah_id": 4787,
    "translation": "也未隨私欲而言。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 4,
    "global_ayah_id": 4788,
    "translation": "這只是他所受的啟示，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 5,
    "global_ayah_id": 4789,
    "translation": "教授他的，是那強健的、"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 6,
    "global_ayah_id": 4790,
    "translation": "有力的，故他達到全美。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 7,
    "global_ayah_id": 4791,
    "translation": "他在東方的最高處，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 8,
    "global_ayah_id": 4792,
    "translation": "然後他漸漸接近而降低，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 9,
    "global_ayah_id": 4793,
    "translation": "他相距兩張弓的長度，或更近一些。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 10,
    "global_ayah_id": 4794,
    "translation": "他把他所應啟示的啟示他的僕人，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 11,
    "global_ayah_id": 4795,
    "translation": "他的心沒有否認他所見的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 12,
    "global_ayah_id": 4796,
    "translation": "難道你們要為他所見的而與他爭論嗎？"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 13,
    "global_ayah_id": 4797,
    "translation": "他確已見他二次下降，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 14,
    "global_ayah_id": 4798,
    "translation": "在極境的酸棗樹旁，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 15,
    "global_ayah_id": 4799,
    "translation": "那裡有歸宿的樂園。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 16,
    "global_ayah_id": 4800,
    "translation": "當酸棗樹蒙上一層東西的時候，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 17,
    "global_ayah_id": 4801,
    "translation": "眼未邪視，也未過分；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 18,
    "global_ayah_id": 4802,
    "translation": "他確已看見他的主的一部分最大的跡象。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 19,
    "global_ayah_id": 4803,
    "translation": "他們告訴我吧！拉特和歐薩，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 20,
    "global_ayah_id": 4804,
    "translation": "以及排行第三，也是最次的默那，怎麼是真主的女兒呢？"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 21,
    "global_ayah_id": 4805,
    "translation": "難道男孩歸你們，女孩卻歸真主嗎？"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 22,
    "global_ayah_id": 4806,
    "translation": "然而，這是不公平的分配。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 23,
    "global_ayah_id": 4807,
    "translation": "這些偶像只是你們和你們的祖先所定的名稱，真主並未加以証實，他們只是憑猜想和私欲。正道確已從他們的主降臨他們。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 24,
    "global_ayah_id": 4808,
    "translation": "難道人希望什麼就有什麼？"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 25,
    "global_ayah_id": 4809,
    "translation": "後世和今世，都是真主的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 26,
    "global_ayah_id": 4810,
    "translation": "天上的許多天神，他們的說情，毫無裨益，除非在真主許可他們為他所意欲和所喜悅者說情之後，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 27,
    "global_ayah_id": 4811,
    "translation": "不信後世的人們，的確以女性的名稱稱呼天神們。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 28,
    "global_ayah_id": 4812,
    "translation": "他們對於那種稱呼，絕無任何知識，他們只憑猜想；而猜想對於真理，確是毫無裨益的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 29,
    "global_ayah_id": 4813,
    "translation": "你應當避開那違背我的教誨，且只欲享今世生活者；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 30,
    "global_ayah_id": 4814,
    "translation": "那是他們的知識程度。你的主，確是全知背離正道者的，也是全知遵循正道者的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 31,
    "global_ayah_id": 4815,
    "translation": "天地萬物，都是真主的。他創造萬物，以便他依作惡者的行為而報酬他們，並以至善的品級報酬行善者。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 32,
    "global_ayah_id": 4816,
    "translation": "遠離大罪和醜事，但犯小罪者，你的主確是寬宥的。當他從大地創造你們的時候，當你們是在母腹中的胎兒的時候，他是全知你們的；所以你們不要自稱清白，他是全知敬畏者的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 33,
    "global_ayah_id": 4817,
    "translation": "你告訴我吧！違背正道，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 34,
    "global_ayah_id": 4818,
    "translation": "稍稍施捨就慳吝的人，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 35,
    "global_ayah_id": 4819,
    "translation": "難道他知道幽玄，故認自己的行為為真理嗎？"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 36,
    "global_ayah_id": 4820,
    "translation": "難道沒有人告訴過他穆薩的經典，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 37,
    "global_ayah_id": 4821,
    "translation": "和履行誡命的易卜拉欣的經典中所記載的事情嗎？"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 38,
    "global_ayah_id": 4822,
    "translation": "一個負罪者，不負別人的罪。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 39,
    "global_ayah_id": 4823,
    "translation": "各人只得享受自己的勞績；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 40,
    "global_ayah_id": 4824,
    "translation": "他的勞績，將被看見，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 41,
    "global_ayah_id": 4825,
    "translation": "然後他將受最完全的報酬。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 42,
    "global_ayah_id": 4826,
    "translation": "你的主，是眾生的歸宿。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 43,
    "global_ayah_id": 4827,
    "translation": "他能使人笑，能使人哭；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 44,
    "global_ayah_id": 4828,
    "translation": "他能使人死，能使人生；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 45,
    "global_ayah_id": 4829,
    "translation": "他曾創造配偶──男性的與女性的──"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 46,
    "global_ayah_id": 4830,
    "translation": "是以射出的精液；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 47,
    "global_ayah_id": 4831,
    "translation": "他以再造為自己的責任；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 48,
    "global_ayah_id": 4832,
    "translation": "他能使人富足，能使人滿意；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 49,
    "global_ayah_id": 4833,
    "translation": "他是天狼星的主。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 50,
    "global_ayah_id": 4834,
    "translation": "他毀滅了古時的阿德人，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 51,
    "global_ayah_id": 4835,
    "translation": "和賽莫德人，而未曾有所遺留；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 52,
    "global_ayah_id": 4836,
    "translation": "以前，他毀滅了努哈的宗族。他們確是更不義的，確是更放蕩的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 53,
    "global_ayah_id": 4837,
    "translation": "他使那被顛覆的城市覆亡，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 54,
    "global_ayah_id": 4838,
    "translation": "故覆蓋的東西曾覆蓋了那城市。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 55,
    "global_ayah_id": 4839,
    "translation": "你懷疑你的主的哪一件恩典呢？"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 56,
    "global_ayah_id": 4840,
    "translation": "這是古時的那些警告者之中的一個警告者。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 57,
    "global_ayah_id": 4841,
    "translation": "臨近的事件，已經臨近了；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 58,
    "global_ayah_id": 4842,
    "translation": "除真主外，沒有能揭示它的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 59,
    "global_ayah_id": 4843,
    "translation": "難道你們為這訓辭而詫異嗎？"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 60,
    "global_ayah_id": 4844,
    "translation": "你們怎麼嘲笑而不痛哭呢？"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 61,
    "global_ayah_id": 4845,
    "translation": "你們是疏忽的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 53,
    "ayah_number": 62,
    "global_ayah_id": 4846,
    "translation": "你們應當為真主而叩頭，應當崇拜他。"
  }
]